From: appkins <nbatkins@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 22:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: wire in the EthernetInterface feature pair

The standard-resource route for BMC-managed NIC IPv4, ported from the
RPi5 platform: EthConfigDxe publishes the EthCfg efivarstore questions
under x-UEFI-redfish-EthernetInterface configure language and applies
them into Ip4Config2 at boot; RedfishEthernetInterfaceDxe and its
collection driver serve /redfish/v1/Systems/1/EthernetInterfaces/{id}
from those questions (upstream edk2-redfish-client has converters for
the schema but no feature driver). The BMC manages the onboard NIC
with plain Redfish and no vendor-specific bridge; the BMC's own USB
gadget link is excluded from both the page and the apply, so a PATCH
here can never cut off the host interface.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [platform policy]

---

diff --git aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
--- aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
+++ bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
@@ -1105,6 +1105,13 @@
   # RedfishPlatformConfigDxe (above) is what answers for HII.
   #
   NucRedfishPkg/NucRedfishSyncDxe/NucRedfishSyncDxe.inf
+  #
+  # BMC-managed IPv4 Setup page for the onboard NIC (EthCfg variable,
+  # applied into Ip4Config2 at boot). Ported from the RPi5; its questions
+  # carry x-UEFI-redfish-EthernetInterface configure language for the
+  # feature driver below.
+  #
+  NucRedfishPkg/EthConfigDxe/EthConfigDxe.inf
 
 #
 # edk2-redfish-client. Its own RedfishClient.dsc.inc is not used, because it
@@ -1121,9 +1128,26 @@
 
 [LibraryClasses]
   !include RedfishClientPkg/RedfishClientLibs.dsc.inc
+  #
+  # Converter libs for the EthernetInterface feature pair below; upstream
+  # ships the converters but maps no lib classes for schemas it has no
+  # feature driver for.
+  #
+  EthernetInterfaceV1_8_0Lib|RedfishClientPkg/ConverterLib/edk2library/EthernetInterface/v1_8_0/Lib.inf
+  EthernetInterfaceCollectionLib|RedfishClientPkg/ConverterLib/edk2library/EthernetInterfaceCollection/Lib.inf
 
 [Components.X64]
   !include RedfishClientPkg/RedfishClientComponents.dsc.inc
+  #
+  # This platform's own EthernetInterface feature/collection drivers
+  # (ported from the RPi5): upstream has converters for the schema but no
+  # feature driver. They serve /Systems/1/EthernetInterfaces/{id} from
+  # EthConfigDxe's questions.
+  #
+  NucRedfishPkg/RedfishEthernetInterfaceDxe/RedfishEthernetInterfaceDxe.inf
+  NucRedfishPkg/RedfishEthernetInterfaceCollectionDxe/RedfishEthernetInterfaceCollectionDxe.inf
+  RedfishClientPkg/Converter/EthernetInterface/v1_8_0/RedfishEthernetInterface_V1_8_0_Dxe.inf
+  RedfishClientPkg/Converter/EthernetInterfaceCollection/RedfishEthernetInterfaceCollection_Dxe.inf
 !endif
 !endif
 !endif
diff --git aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
--- aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
+++ bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
@@ -395,8 +395,13 @@ INF MdeModulePkg/Application/BootManagerMenuApp/BootManagerMenuApp.inf
   INF MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/NetworkCommon/NetworkCommon.inf
   INF MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbCdcEcm/UsbCdcEcm.inf
   INF NucRedfishPkg/NucRedfishSyncDxe/NucRedfishSyncDxe.inf
+  INF NucRedfishPkg/EthConfigDxe/EthConfigDxe.inf
 !if $(REDFISH_CLIENT) == TRUE
   !include RedfishClientPkg/RedfishClient.fdf.inc
+  INF NucRedfishPkg/RedfishEthernetInterfaceDxe/RedfishEthernetInterfaceDxe.inf
+  INF NucRedfishPkg/RedfishEthernetInterfaceCollectionDxe/RedfishEthernetInterfaceCollectionDxe.inf
+  INF RedfishClientPkg/Converter/EthernetInterface/v1_8_0/RedfishEthernetInterface_V1_8_0_Dxe.inf
+  INF RedfishClientPkg/Converter/EthernetInterfaceCollection/RedfishEthernetInterfaceCollection_Dxe.inf
 !endif
 !endif
 !endif
